  <item>
    <title>004 村子里，那个不结婚的人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63188a44e50e37575adb1e69</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63188a44e50e37575adb1e69</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 Sep 2022 12:10:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>人的一生不过是一场可以自由选择的游戏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这个游戏里又存在着不同的闯关模式。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有些模式是组建家庭，携手并进，有些模式是孤身一人，单打独斗。</span></p><span></span><p><span>婚姻是如此，工作也是如此。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但现在现状已然成为：因为组建家庭占了大多数也就掌握了话语权，就昭告天下说他们才是真理，才是人人应该心向往之的模式……</span></p><span></span><p><span>被这种认知霸权挤压的越厉害，以及目睹现实中的狼藉和困境越多，我就越是对自己的坚持充满了感激，因为我自己的坚持，孤注一掷，让我从这场迷幻盛宴中脱身出来，我不愿意成为那一部分双目浑浊的认命的人。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsJkHewXpdG7sEvJKAauzyEHnx02.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjF7gzLwo8ciOHrpnDgWMJkqIEt3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiM-Ilndpd3-9fmK_akA35LapB-f.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjbkjVA0dEf_poWhBNLS3_k3vZkj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk4Duj1KH9gTJLc3OvZEbg45mmDi.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="162">02:42</a> 坚持不婚是认知的刷新和更迭所产生的结果</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 当稳固的生活成为一种消耗</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="601">10:01</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;我为什么不结婚</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="636">10:36</a> &nbsp;我内心深处的“男本位”观念在作祟</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="837">13:57</a> &nbsp;36岁从上海离职返乡，我成了村子里唯一不结婚的人</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">16:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;遭遇村里人的质疑和挑衅，我如何自处</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1099">18:19</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;接受自己的平凡和人生的缺憾</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1221">20:21</a> &nbsp;人的一生不过是一场可以自由选择的游戏</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1325">22:05</a> &nbsp;不结婚的人需要更周密的自我规划与管理</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1624">27:04</a> &nbsp;电影推荐</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1942">32:22</a> &nbsp;彩蛋</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvDnmIqOtAGAyr2xj4dpXxv_tt-U.m4a" length="38490963" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZuX21OSFozbE4zT1Y4ajllMWVVTG1mRFJxYmcucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>003 不达标的人，我们家有四个</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62deaaddfa15142e17251fea</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62deaaddfa15142e17251fea</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 25 Jul 2022 14:38:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从出生开始，我们就在考试。毕业证，录取通知书，驾照，技能考级，结婚证，房产证，每一项的考试都有对应的达标和不达标的人，也有给达标的人准备的对应的证书。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里的每一个人都被安放在，一个由钢筋，水泥，红砖和铝合金铸造的容器里，进进出出，人情世故，吃喝拉撒，生老病死。</span></p><span></span><p><span>像一个不会终结的超大型的现代艺术展览。</span></p><span></span><p><span>每一个人都在围观他人，同时也在被展示，被他人所围观。</span></p><span></span><p><span>相互围观的过程中，再生出一些温情或凉薄的意味来。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FmW-M2TYMetz4vs7gpDRIbvfSEeF.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fiyeg4_BCi6E6k3LdV2IlCrgOw8N.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fhb-9Q8cpa-maB3nj2hJd-4s47r6.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FmvKt9-TOeO_hx1yTenPsXvrkClm.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FnnOTs2s2VK8-rk7BmV3VmBfiw89.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FqbgwP3n5B4n_HkLTAXvee-UIwz3.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 《隐入尘烟》的观影感受</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a> 《隐入尘烟》导演创作手记</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> &nbsp;失眠的夜里，我把我还给用于沉思的自己</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1015">16:55</a> &nbsp;父亲用暴力织就的衣服</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">19:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;小吕辍学后开启的日结人生</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1876">31:16</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;小吕零工生活的结束</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">33:55</a> &nbsp;对婚育的谨慎让我们成为“不达标的人”</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2038">33:58</a> &nbsp;对父亲说出了因暴力导致的缺憾与伤痛</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2373">39:33</a> &nbsp;父亲的反思与改变</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2493">41:33</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;亲情之爱推到误解与隔阂的石墙</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltFSG7dQY6dIS644kvbDQgOPU5ES.m4a" length="47628076" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:04</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZyMlZpLUUtR3ZXR2RNSnB3Q1FCNlBjMl9aV3IucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>002 会有好事发生？《我的解放日志》VS《我的隔离日志》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/628e32bd6c7eec4d0113c95b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">628e32bd6c7eec4d0113c95b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 May 2022 13:44:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期聊一聊观看《我的解放日志》之后引发的思考&amp;如电影《土拨鼠之日》般死寂单一的隔离日常，以及在这其中是如何自处的……</span></p><span></span><p><span>“看的过程，让我找回了一些千禧年国剧的影子，那些看似可有可无的，对日常的描摹，那些有着真实触感的，带着体温的情绪和感受，从容又真诚……”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“当我准备做这期节目的时候，我翻看了自己这些日子的朋友圈，发现我除了给对面的树拍照，然后转发了一篇又一篇的，大部分都已消失不见的公众号文章，剩下的好像什么也没做。日子就像我每晚0点之后发到小区群里的抗原自测照片，自测工具一致，结果一致，拍摄角度一致，前天，昨天，今天，明天，循环往复。”</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltPSnQrsHv06jHA-zyTNDoqURmSj.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><code><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="248">04:08</a></span></strong></code><strong><span> &nbsp;《我的解放日志》带给我久违的追剧快乐</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><code><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">11:11</a></span></strong></code><strong><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《贫嘴张大民的幸福生活》《浪漫的事》《给父母的信》</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><code><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="883">14:43</a></span></strong></code><strong><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;被困在《土拨鼠之日》里，我开始给窗外的树拍照</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><code><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">22:45</a></span></strong></code><strong><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;封控前的盒马大采购以及“买对了”的娃娃菜</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><code><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1676">27:56</a></span></strong></code><strong><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;让我倍感温暖的父亲“突然的关心”</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><code><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a></span></strong></code><strong><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;通过抖音发出求救信号的来沪务工人员</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><code><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a></span></strong></code><strong><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;我的朋友中招了，当天就去了方舱</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><code><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a></span></strong></code><strong><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;小区长椅上被驱赶的人</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><code><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a></span></strong></code><strong><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;“上海电话亭女士”带给我的震撼</span></strong><a href="https://s.cyol.com/articles/2022-05/04/content_k66NdOcG.html?gid=Pjk3GBkq" data-url="https://s.cyol.com/articles/2022-05/04/content_k66NdOcG.html?gid=Pjk3GBkq"><span>对话上海电话亭女士的原文链接</span></a></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr1bn3Mu4UC42eba0MrQUAaRgOBW.m4a" length="56404177" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:57:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZuVEYwZDhra0JPd1RucUVPTkd5bGdJV0drRnQucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>001 是的，我36岁, 刚被公司辞退，准备搬去乡下</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62794244313328e9c23c78ee</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62794244313328e9c23c78ee</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 May 2022 16:33:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天是2022年5月9号，我在上海。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是我居家隔离的第40天。</span></p><span></span><p><span>近半年多的时间，我经历了：决心搬离上海定居杭州再到被公司辞退，然后在遭遇公司HR以及直属领导PUA的高压之下，努力争取赔偿，最后拿到赔偿顺利离职，再到休假以及至今为止（和大多数人一样）依然受困于漫长的疫情封控等等这一系列密集的事件。借由本期播客，我想梳理一下这些事件的过程以及这些事件对我造成的冲击和感悟。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjxWlGa4y0wdxJiqVPj5KmLuJ0hJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> &nbsp;自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> &nbsp;关于年龄焦虑的反思和社恐人的职场处境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="333">05:33</a> &nbsp;年龄焦虑原由大起底</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="399">06:39</a> &nbsp;我在工位四周竖起了围栏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="686">11:26</a> &nbsp;我被胁迫离职</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="782">13:02</a> 离职后我不想再上班</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> &nbsp;与青春期的自己对望&amp;粉红女郎里的上海</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> &nbsp;低欲望生活的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a> “家”是我对世界热爱的具象表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1268">21:08</a> &nbsp;给自己一个机会，像孩童一样去创造</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1347">22:27</a> &nbsp;去做吧，做那些会产生心流的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1383">23:03</a> &nbsp;大推荐之《岁月的童话》和神龙士力架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1555">25:55</a> &nbsp;第一期结束啦！</span></p>]]></description>
